		{"id":"3062dfcec8b7d9c3","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017175729.png","x":-953,"y":-1540,"width":393,"height":400},
		{"id":"2536ee6b90817fd7","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017175710.png","x":-1080,"y":-1081,"width":400,"height":386},
		{"id":"ef49fa4fb766ce0d","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017180216.png","x":-3440,"y":-1780,"width":469,"height":440},
		{"id":"e03b0025da79edab","type":"text","text":"**DEAD CASES**\n\nLAVATORY\nCLOSET\nATTIC\nFURNACE\nSOLARIUM\n","x":-2880,"y":-1613,"width":169,"height":273},
		{"id":"1401e7727d0af12f","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017180323.png","x":-3440,"y":-1230,"width":400,"height":363},
		{"id":"3a2fdab126ed479f","type":"text","text":"**CORNER CASES**\n\nPARLOR\n✅ PATIO\n✅ NOOK\n✅ OFFICE\nLIBRARY\n✅ PANTRY\n","x":-2975,"y":-1200,"width":244,"height":273},
		{"id":"3f9e1752034b60ce","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017180607.png","x":-3440,"y":-760,"width":392,"height":400},
		{"id":"fea69ca787a45769","type":"text","text":"**SUSPECT LIST**\n\nROSE BALI, Age 50\nRICHARD SCOTT, Age 12\nFROND MAYFORD, Age 32\nSANDRA DILLON, Age 14\nBO LEE, Age 16\nCHARLES RISCAL, Age 12\nCHRISTOPH CLARKE, Age 25","x":-2960,"y":-720,"width":297,"height":273},
		{"id":"0ec0a5d8552949da","type":"text","text":"So tome after tome that the (**library**) loaned,\nAnd the books the he had that he already owned\nWere searched from their (**cover**) all (**the way**) through,\nIf he found a new clue, he'd know what to do.","x":-1672,"y":-1048,"width":439,"height":132},
		{"id":"3f564608c11ead33","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181326.png","x":-402,"y":-1190,"width":642,"height":417},
		{"id":"d77b588e8f338535","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181413.png","x":-2853,"y":-2060,"width":400,"height":303},
		{"id":"e47644c9069ac853","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181445.png","x":-2520,"y":-1673,"width":400,"height":232},
		{"id":"fd2a4523a6592cb5","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017175906.png","x":-2280,"y":-1072,"width":400,"height":156},
		{"id":"d0bcd6ee4cb90e87","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017174327.png","x":-2080,"y":-760,"width":816,"height":380},
		{"id":"62bca8eade569574","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017180954.png","x":-1582,"y":-2413,"width":400,"height":347},
		{"id":"294e912f291915bf","type":"text","text":"==🔴TENDER CIPHER==\n==🟢LUNAR RENAMED==\n==🟣UNCLE AWE==\n==🔵DRAFT THE SIXES==","x":-1043,"y":-2292,"width":181,"height":119},
		{"id":"85054a6623f0c4ea","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181656.png","x":-1760,"y":-1805,"width":400,"height":308},
		{"id":"933654c55dc5f1e3","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181637.png","x":-2160,"y":-2120,"width":400,"height":256},
		{"id":"d0c8d8faa426ab8d","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181142.png","x":-560,"y":-3060,"width":1392,"height":1068},
		{"id":"f863179a654035c7","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181743.png","x":-4800,"y":-2385,"width":400,"height":193},
		{"id":"3f44eef6e6ecf45c","type":"text","text":"All he needed was to find a new clue,\nIf he found a new clue, he’d know what to do,\nIf he knew what to do, he’d likely tell you,\nFor you are looking for a new clue too!","x":-4340,"y":-2357,"width":380,"height":137},
		{"id":"84eadee65ac948c9","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017181824.png","x":-4800,"y":-2165,"width":400,"height":177},
		{"id":"6ad2dd7a79cca96f","type":"text","text":"He had retraced his sketches and studied the files,\nReviewed all his cases and gone through the piles\nOf the evidence present and precedents evident,\nAnd retraced his steps, as it stretched on for miles.","x":-4340,"y":-2139,"width":420,"height":126},
		{"id":"f6d31df6b6a17567","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182047.png","x":-4800,"y":-1945,"width":400,"height":168},
		{"id":"9f886a70f9b63d41","type":"text","text":"He had looked high and low in all of the rooms,\nHe had searched every corner in each of the tombs,\nIn this particular case, he had checked every space.\nIf he found a new clue, he’d know what to do.","x":-4320,"y":-1926,"width":420,"height":131},
		{"id":"fe316ba3d76a1adb","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182200.png","x":-4800,"y":-863,"width":400,"height":178},
		{"id":"4363696151a05481","type":"text","text":"“A man obsessed, and cuckoo too”,\nThey would say as he would wander through.\nThe best medicine is not yet evidence,\nIf he found a new clue, he’d know what to do.","x":-4330,"y":-836,"width":380,"height":124},
		{"id":"ed2a32e2ddb074f9","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182209.png","x":-4800,"y":-619,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"6b7ba2433d6bbf0f","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182222 1.png","x":-4800,"y":-382,"width":400,"height":189},
		{"id":"46056edeaff1ad3d","type":"text","text":"Or is there perhaps something new,\nSomething overlooked but now in view,\nHave you finally found it? Could it really be true?\nIf it’s a new clue, you know what to do.","x":-4330,"y":-357,"width":390,"height":140},
		{"id":"013faf44d4fc8e73","type":"text","text":"And having read this book so many times,\nHaving scoured over each of its cryptic lines,\nHave you exhausted your search?\nHave you seen all the signs?","x":-4320,"y":-592,"width":360,"height":127},
		{"id":"638a5627ac57f902","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182055.png","x":-4800,"y":-1745,"width":400,"height":159},
		{"id":"6c184d68a37f57c2","type":"text","text":"He looked and he looked under beds and in nooks,\nHe questioned the maids, he questioned the cooks,\nIt was already over when he spoke to the chauffeur,\nWho told him new clues were found only in books.","x":-4320,"y":-1733,"width":420,"height":135},
		{"id":"a952432e0f168323","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182143.png","x":-4800,"y":-1104,"width":400,"height":175},
		{"id":"546e1d8a9747691a","type":"text","text":"He stayed up all night and studied the maps,\nHe laid out the floorplans and measured the gaps,\nAnd if his directory was considered a trajectory,\nIt was nothing short of a full mental lapse.","x":-4340,"y":-1086,"width":400,"height":139},
		{"id":"e8d6f43113b9a27f","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182119.png","x":-4800,"y":-1526,"width":400,"height":169},
		{"id":"04d9e1c6344b03a0","type":"file","file":"Images/Pasted image 20261017182132.png","x":-4800,"y":-1304,"width":400,"height":146},
		{"id":"2d31a3d2b9bfbdc5","type":"text","text":"He changed all the letters in the lines that he found,\nHe checked all the colors of the spines that were bound,\nHe doubled the meaning of each seasonal greeting,\nAnd found that the diction of each word was sound.","x":-4340,"y":-1304,"width":480,"height":146},
		{"id":"e75119f24ae3211d","type":"text","text":"So tome after tome that the library loaned,\nAnd the books that he had that he already owned,\nWere searched from their covers all the way through,\nIf he found a new clue, he’d know what to do.","x":-4310,"y":-1516,"width":420,"height":149}
	],
